   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRANT DISBURSEMENT CIP CENTRO DE INTEGRIDADE PUBLI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAIS INTEGRIDADE is made up of seven Civil Society Organisations, namely: Episcopal Justice and Peace Commission (CEJP) of the Catholic Church; Center for Public Integrity (CIP); Nucleus of Women&apos;s Associations of Zamb&#xe9;zia (NAFEZA); Solidarity Mozambique (SoldMoz); Civil Society Learning and Training Center (CESC), and Mozambican Chapter of the Institute for Social Communication of Southern Africa (MISA Mozambique). The project Melhorando as estrat&#xe9;gias de observa&#xe7;&#xe3;o eleitoral em Mo&#xe7;ambique aims to promote transparency and integrity in the 2024 general elections to be held on October 9Specifically the project will focus on:&#x2022; Producing credible information about the various phases of the electoral process&#x2022; Promoting the conduct of electoral processes based on national legislation and international standards</narrative>
  </description>
